{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017YaNvubdBezMM64FNvYXmK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"14B scale强验证 + 理论section提供可验证预测 + 3/3 seed一致 → 审稿人接受'task formalization + systematic atlas'作为充分贡献，4.0 accept\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"14B (Qwen2.5-14B FP16) depth signal与1B量级一致：4-class acc ≥75%, d1v2 AUC ≥0.82, p90_ppl/var_surprisal仍在top-4\"\n      - \"理论section从Shumailov tail erosion + Dohmatob contraction rate推导出EDD上界，预测EDD=4±1，与三模型实证EDD=4吻合\"\n      - \"OLMo seed43与seed42一致（Δ<2.5pp），三模型cross-seed max Δ<3pp，seed robustness无争议\"\n      - \"Binoculars/Fast-DetectGPT ordinal baseline 4-class acc <45%（接近chance），证明现有binary detector不具备ordinal能力\"\n      - \"审稿人认可EMNLP 'New Missions' track对task formalization + data governance的明确call，不要求novel算法\"\n      - \"instruct model弱信号(47.4%)被接受为'RLHF regularizes depth signal'的独立发现而非limitation\"\n    number_ranges:\n      14b_4class_acc: [75, 83]\n      14b_d1v2_auc: [0.82, 0.92]\n      14b_feature_top4_overlap_with_1b: [3, 4]  # out of 4\n      olmo_seed43_4class_acc: [77, 81]\n      cross_seed_max_delta_pp: [0, 2.5]\n      detector_ordinal_baseline_4class_acc: [25, 45]\n      # 以下为locked-in指标，三档相同\n      within_strategy_acc_range: [69.6, 85.4]\n      edd_across_3models: [4, 4]\n      cross_model_loo_mean: [66.4, 66.4]\n      cross_strategy_pipeline_acc: [70.5, 70.5]\n      prompted_gen_acc: [69.5, 69.5]\n      projected_reviewer_avg: [3.5, 4.0]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始framing完全成立。三条claim无需调整：(1) ordinal depth estimation feasible + robust across 1B-14B，\n      (2) Atlas/EDD作为primary contribution，理论section提供model collapse → tail erosion → EDD上界的完整链条，\n      (3) cross-strategy pipeline (+11.5pp)作为practical contribution。14B clean实验彻底消除\"small model only\"质疑。\n      论文定位\"task formalization + theoretical grounding + systematic empirical atlas + practical framework\"，\n      对标HELM/MMLU类benchmark paper在top venue的先例。DCOL失败写入negative analysis section（半页），\n      反而加强\"feature-based方法优于end-to-end\"的结论。instruct model弱信号写入Discussion作为\"RLHF effect on recursive signal\"的新发现。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"14B信号存在但减弱 + 理论section仅提供直觉性连接 + 至少一位审稿人质疑method novelty → 3.0-3.5 borderline，需champion reviewer\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"14B depth signal存在但弱于1B：4-class acc 62-74%, d1v2 AUC 0.70-0.81，feature ranking部分偏移（top-4仅2-3个与1B重叠）\"\n      - \"理论section提供Shumailov tail erosion的定性连接，但EDD上界推导依赖过强假设（i.i.d. generation），审稿人认为'descriptive rather than rigorous'\"\n      - \"OLMo seed43轻微偏低（Δ 2.5-5pp），cross-seed variance需在paper中显式报告并讨论\"\n      - \"Binoculars/Fast-DetectGPT ordinal baseline达到45-60%，部分设置接近我们的弱cell(topk50)，削弱方法独特性\"\n      - \"至少一位审稿人认为cross-strategy pipeline的strategy classifier太弱(57.8%)，pipeline improvement是'engineering trick rather than scientific insight'\"\n      - \"审稿人接受Atlas/EDD价值，但要求补充实验或调整claim强度\"\n    number_ranges:\n      14b_4class_acc: [62, 74]\n      14b_d1v2_auc: [0.70, 0.81]\n      14b_feature_top4_overlap_with_1b: [2, 3]\n      olmo_seed43_4class_acc: [74, 78]\n      cross_seed_max_delta_pp: [2.5, 5.0]\n      detector_ordinal_baseline_4class_acc: [45, 60]\n      within_strategy_acc_range: [69.6, 85.4]\n      edd_across_3models: [4, 4]\n      cross_model_loo_mean: [66.4, 66.4]\n      cross_strategy_pipeline_acc: [70.5, 70.5]\n      prompted_gen_acc: [69.5, 69.5]\n      projected_reviewer_avg: [3.0, 3.5]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      Claim 1调整：将\"robust across scales\"改为\"feasible at 1B with signal persisting but attenuated at 14B\"，\n      14B结果从\"confirms scale robustness\"降级为\"provides preliminary evidence of scale persistence\"。\n      Claim 2(Atlas/EDD)不变，仍为primary。理论section保留但标注为\"theoretical motivation\"而非\"theoretical contribution\"，\n      不列入contribution list。Claim 3(cross-strategy pipeline)需诚实报告strategy classifier瓶颈(57.8%)，\n      将narrative从\"solves cross-strategy deployment\"调整为\"demonstrates feasibility with clear bottleneck for future work\"。\n      补充实验方向：(a) 14B多策略验证（如果时间允许），(b) reference model sensitivity扩展，(c) 更多wild data验证。\n      instruct model弱信号 + 14B减弱共同构成\"depth signal is strongest in base models at moderate scale\"的bounded claim。\n      论文需要一位认可problem formalization价值的champion reviewer。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"14B信号极弱/消失 + 理论section被视为post-hoc + 两位以上审稿人认为无method贡献 → 2.5-3.0，需reframe但仍冲EMNLP Main\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"14B depth signal极弱或消失：4-class acc <62% (接近instruct model的47%), d1v2 AUC <0.70，feature ranking与1B显著不同\"\n      - \"理论section无法产出可验证预测，被审稿人视为'retrospective rationalization of known model collapse dynamics'\"\n      - \"OLMo seed43偏差较大（Δ>5pp），暴露seed sensitivity问题，需在paper中加入variance analysis section\"\n      - \"Binoculars/Fast-DetectGPT ordinal baseline超过60%，在部分设置上接近或超过RF，削弱'task需要specialized approach'的叙事\"\n      - \"14B弱 + instruct弱(47.4%) + DCOL失败 = 审稿人总结为'phenomenon specific to small base models with LoRA fine-tuning，practical relevance unclear'\"\n      - \"cross-strategy d1v2反转(AUC 0.13)被视为fundamental limitation而非interesting finding\"\n    number_ranges:\n      14b_4class_acc: [45, 61]\n      14b_d1v2_auc: [0.55, 0.69]\n      14b_feature_top4_overlap_with_1b: [0, 2]\n      olmo_seed43_4class_acc: [70, 75]\n      cross_seed_max_delta_pp: [5.0, 8.0]\n      detector_ordinal_baseline_4class_acc: [55, 68]\n      within_strategy_acc_range: [69.6, 85.4]\n      edd_across_3models: [4, 4]\n      cross_model_loo_mean: [66.4, 66.4]\n      cross_strategy_pipeline_acc: [70.5, 70.5]\n      prompted_gen_acc: [69.5, 69.5]\n      projected_reviewer_avg: [2.5, 3.0]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      核心reframe：从\"depth estimation is feasible and robust\"转向\"characterizing the boundary conditions of \n      recursive depth signal\"。14B弱信号不再是limitation而是central finding——depth signal的scale-dependent decay \n      itself是对model collapse文献的贡献：1B-scale模型在recursive fine-tuning中产生强depth signal，14B-scale模型\n      因capacity更大而延缓了distributional collapse，导致adjacent-depth信号变弱。这个interpretation需要理论支撑\n      （高capacity → slower convergence to attractor → weaker inter-depth features），即使理论section不完美也\n      至少能提供方向。Atlas/EDD仍为primary，但EDD的意义从\"practical tool for depth estimation\"转向\n      \"diagnostic metric for scale-dependent collapse dynamics\"。Claim 1从\"feasible and robust\"收缩为\n      \"feasible at moderate scale under controlled conditions, with empirically characterized limits\"。\n      Claim 3(cross-strategy pipeline)降为minor contribution或移入Appendix。论文重心移至：\n      (a) 第一个ordinal depth estimation的task formalization（仍成立），\n      (b) Atlas揭示depth signal的model-scale × strategy × architecture三维交互（1B强/14B弱/instruct弱 = 完整picture），\n      (c) 负面结果的系统性价值（DCOL失败 + 14B弱 + instruct弱 + cross-strategy反转 = 共同约束future work的search space）。\n      仍冲EMNLP Main \"New Missions\" track——\"mapping where the signal exists and where it breaks\"本身是对\n      data contamination governance的贡献。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":53855,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":53855},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd559bc5-92e7-4602-a260-f41412311aa0","uuid":"91f063c6-dca2-4e66-ac1e-7ce7139c9b21"}
